    "body": "STOPPED: blocked by #3300. Claim released.\n\nHeld work is on `mkinney:issue/2870-five-axis` at e8dd91ed3.\nThe branch has the original model generator, mesh, script, project, tests, and decision record.\nIt has no NC program and no draft PR.\n\nThe initial pin `catalog_multiaxis_five_axis::posts_three_clean_five_axis_operations` failed on unchanged code because the case was missing.\nThe final script generates all three operations and passes `cam.verify()`.\nPosting refuses the first tilted feed because the initial A angle is unknown.\nThe opening rapid moves do not state the rotary pose.\nThe rate guard remains unchanged.\n\nNo mutation check, quick gate, clippy run, or catalog parity check completed because posting is blocked.\nNo NC or CL golden changed.\nThe overlap checks found no open PR for the intended files.\n\nThe OBJ importer also refused legal duplicate vertex records. Issue #3298 tracks that defect.\nThe generator writes each vertex once as a workaround.\nBoth defects are linked on #2392.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
