    "body": "Held: the review of PR #4408 found a defect on main that blocks this case. The defect is #4417.\n\n- The Fanuc post writes the stream `A` and `B` words (pose law `Ry(B) · Rx(A) · Z`) for a machine whose chain is `Rx(A) · Ry(B) · Z`.\n- The diff of PR #4408 does not cause the defect. But `five-axis.nc` records the result as a golden.\n- The review: https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/pull/4408#issuecomment-7225976287\n\nPR #4408 stays an open draft at e850da857abe760033530d749d0e93a6f0a63795 with `needs-rework`. No commit was pushed in this round.\nAfter #4417 is decided, rebuild `five-axis.nc` and `five-axis.camproj` with `cargo xtask catalog --case multiaxis/five-axis` on the branch `mkinney:issue/2870-five-axis`, then gate again.\n",
